3. Rust dependencies
================================================================================

LoadBear links a number of Rust crates, each under its own licence, almost all
MIT or Apache-2.0. The authoritative list for any given build is Cargo.lock in
this repository. To produce a full report:

  cargo install cargo-about
  cargo about generate about.hbs
